<title>POLAND: Polish food prices rise 0.1 pct in Feb 1-10.</title>
<headline>Polish food prices rise 0.1 pct in Feb 1-10.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish food prices rose 0.1 percent in the February 1-10 period after rising 0.2 percent in the previous 10 days and were 0.5 percent higher than in the January 1-10 period, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.  </p>
<p>				  FEB 1-10     JAN 20-30  LAST 30 DAYS</p>
<p>POLISH FOOD PRICES (AVG)	0.1	   0.2	  0.5 (1.5)</p>
<p> Bread				0.9	   0.4	  1.8 (1.7)</p>
<p> Fruit and vegetables	  -1.1	  -0.1	 -0.6 (3.5)</p>
<p> Meat and meat-products	-0.2	  -0.1	 -0.2 (0.1)</p>
<p> Dairy products		   0.6	   0.7	  1.5 (1.8)</p>
<p> Eggs				-1.6	  -0.3	 -2.0 (0.7)</p>
<p>NOTE: In brackets figures for the previous 30-day period ending on December 31, 1996. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
